You have the right goddess; unfortunately, nethack does not.  It's supposed
to be Apollo.  I wondered about that, for no particular reason.

As long as it's going to be called Delphi, there's one feature you could
copy from the real place.  A few hundred yards from the temple of Apollo,
there's a cave going down into a mountain that's filled with carbon dioxide.
Anyone who enters it just keels over and dies after a few minutes.  The
Greeks thought this was an entrance to Hades; why not copy it?  You could
have a permanent level teleporter (doesn't go away when you use it) just
outside the temple, that always takes you to hell.
